The interpreter enumerates x U x U y U y with Eker's matcher: x by
decreasing size (b U c U c, a U b U c, a U c U c, b U c, ...); elanc-go in
REM's order (REM's maximal extract for y, from the largest down, the rest
twice x: g_x2y2u): y = b U c U c, a U b U c, b U c, a U b, b, a U c U c, ...
The same solutions in another order (not the reverse of the
interpreter's: checked on this program).
